Package: chromodoris
Title: Chromodoris Plots of Many Time Series
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jeffrey", "Girard", , "me@jmgirard.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws the Chromodoris plot: many time series (one per rater
    or unit) summarized moment by moment as nested quantile ribbons around
    a center line, as a ggplot2 extension with a low-level stat and a
    high-level wrapper.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jmgirard/chromodoris
BugReports: https://github.com/jmgirard/chromodoris/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    cli,
    ggplot2,
    rlang
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
